# scratch output from manual OIDC testing. `cookies.txt` and the *.log files
# have held real session cookies and tokens; nothing in the repo needs them.
cookies.txt
*.log

# One-off curl captures (d.json, j.json, r.json, toks.json, login.json,
# parts.txt, verify.js) are removed from the tree rather than ignored: the names
# are too generic to ignore safely without shadowing real files later.

# generated design tokens (regenerate with `npm run tokens:build`)
# src/app/tokens.css is intentionally NOT ignored: it is committed so the app
# builds without a token-compilation step. tokens/tokens.json is the source.

